        "uuid": "4311a763_f733d6c3",
        "filename": "android/visibility.go",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 113,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002751
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-04-16T22:05:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s slightly more efficient, as strings are immutable in Go so every +\u003d here is a malloc + strcpy.  Creating a list of strings just stores pointers to the strings, and then Join can do a single malloc and copy each string once.  It\u0027s unfortunately also idomatic in Go to have to do loop copies like this.  Maybe it will get better when Go gets generics.",
      "parentUuid": "7cbf8f5a_0ad8f014",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 112,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 113,
        "endChar": 12
      },
      "revId": "63e4e2dc3fe23e9fdd1c3d2cfe3c4dca128953a8",
