      "writtenOn": "2019-04-10T06:22:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since this happens after the arch mutator, it is going to visit every variant of each module, all of which will have the same visibility and the same qualified module name.  Maybe use ctx.PrimaryModule() to only run it once?  Or move the rule gatherer early, after LoadHooks but before any variants?",
      "revId": "63e4e2dc3fe23e9fdd1c3d2cfe3c4dca128953a8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
